    "response": "Given the budget constraint of 15,000 PKR per month, here are three AI solutions that can help a bakery manage repeated WhatsApp questions more efficiently:\n\n### 1. **WhatsApp Business API with AI Chatbot**\n- **Description:** Integrate the WhatsApp Business API with an AI chatbot to automate responses to frequently asked questions. This chatbot can be trained to recognize common queries and provide quick, accurate answers.\n- **Implementation:** The AI chatbot can be developed using platforms like Dialogflow (now part of Google Cloud) or IBM Watson Assistant. These platforms offer pre-built templates and integrations with the WhatsApp Business API.\n- **Cost:** The cost for developing and maintaining an AI chatbot can be significantly lower than hiring a human representative, especially if you use a platform that offers free or low-cost plans. For example, Dialogflow offers a free tier that can be sufficient for basic needs.\n- **Benefits:** Reduces the need for human intervention, which can be more expensive, and improves response times. It also allows the bakery to maintain a consistent and professional response to frequently asked questions.\n\n### 2. **Automated WhatsApp Response System**\n- **Description:** Develop an automated system that uses natural language processing (NLP) to understand and respond to common WhatsApp inquiries. This system can be integrated with the bakery’s existing customer service system to ensure consistency.\n- **Implementation:** Use NLP libraries and APIs (such as Wit.ai, Microsoft Azure Text Analytics, or IBM Watson Natural Language Understanding) to create a system that can understand and respond to common queries. This system can be trained to recognize patterns in customer inquiries and provide appropriate responses.\n- **Cost:** The cost for developing and maintaining such a system can be lower than hiring a human representative, especially if you use open-source or low-cost NLP libraries.\n- **Benefits:** Reduces the workload on human customer service representatives, which can help in managing the budget. It also ensures that responses are consistent and professional.\n\n### 3. **WhatsApp Business Automation Tool**\n- **Description:** Utilize a tool that automates responses to common WhatsApp inquiries. These tools can be integrated into the bakery’s WhatsApp account and can be programmed to send pre-written responses",
